# The failure paths: a failed build-libc.py (planted, or the real script on
# the stand-in build, which has no clang) fails the leg without a lit run
# and keeps build-builtins.py's output in the setup log; a failed
# build-builtins.py stops the setup before build-libc.py; and the order
# check rejects calls in the other order or without the build directory.
